sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant BM as BiometricManager
    participant KS as Keystore (Ch 20)
    participant BP as BiometricPrompt
    participant SS as SecureStore

    VM->>BM: canAuthenticate(STRONG)?
    BM-->>VM: success
    VM->>KS: Cipher.init DECRYPT with auth-bound key
    KS-->>VM: cipher (locked until auth)
    VM->>BP: authenticate(CryptoObject cipher)
    User->>BP: fingerprint
    BP-->>VM: onAuthenticationSucceeded(crypto)
    VM->>SS: decrypt secret USING crypto.cipher
    SS-->>VM: plaintext secret -> proceed
